FFmpeg
------
Quillon's default render mode drives the ffmpeg binary found on the user's
PATH. Quillon does not distribute or bundle FFmpeg. FFmpeg is licensed under
the LGPLv2.1 or later (or GPLv2+ / GPLv3+, depending on how the user's build
was configured); see https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html and the license that came
with the user's FFmpeg build. Optional in-process libav builds are a local
build option chosen by the user, not an artifact distributed by this project.

